Package: com.example.splitcarplay
Name: SplitCarPlay
Version: 0.9.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: Companion app (Trang chủ/Trên xe/Mô phỏng/Tài khoản) for a side-by-side CarPlay split screen, with a speed card that reads Vietmap Live's speed/limit. On-car hosting is an opt-in, one-shot experiment with auto tear-down; see ROADMAP.md.
